    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How strong is a bond between two childhood friends?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This adult visual novel, allows you to take the role of one of two Geordie lads as they prepare for the next chapter of life as they finish school and head to university. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544480/extras/9d74878e18a44c09a34eba009c42115d.avif?t=1743023803\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one has been keeping a big secret from his best mate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544480/extras/92d7ca6c2779aa07e7dff38471bc2525.avif?t=1743023803\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will their friendship end when the secret is uncovered? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544480/extras/06bc143dc9281805f4b349d69cad76cc.avif?t=1743023803\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will it flourish?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544480/extras/bca573aa071a067a4318c558bc3dad27.avif?t=1743023803\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the story unfold through the eyes of either friend in this trans positive, fully 3D rendered, adult kinetic novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience their journey through discovery of themselves, each other, their family, friends and other people they meet along the way.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note this is a KINETIC NOVEL, which means it was intentionally written with limited choices, this is not a create your own adventure type of experience.</p>",
